  "schema": "hepta.hia.reference-profile-successors.v1",
  "scope": "Explicit reference-profile selection and transfer of three checked QA packaging inputs only. Original source files are reconstructed in full and replayed forward. Production native defaults, test assertions, input domains, and timeouts are unchanged. Continuation reference wheels stage the complete same-source contract before the original 120-second setup.py build. The resource-source row is now an exact identity relation: the three support paths are already independently selected before the tuple is finalized, so the duplicate append is removed."
